//! Native binary64 hyperbolic functions, cube root, and two-argument hypotenuse.
//! Ports of OpenLibm at 57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e:
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/e_sinh.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/e_cosh.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/s_tanh.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/s_asinh.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/e_acosh.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/e_atanh.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/s_cbrt.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/e_hypot.c
//! https://github.com/JuliaMath/openlibm/blob/57dd0f905df7b8b49d638b0007a64a08a5d6535e/src/k_exp.c
//! Arithmetic ordering, word thresholds, and scaling follow the original.
//! Floating-point exception flags are not exposed by the JavaScript API;
//! branches whose only additional effect was raising inexact return directly.
//! The source bounds cbrt error below 0.667 ulp and hypot below 1 ulp;
//! these are nearly rounded algorithms, not a correct-rounding guarantee.
